H0609G.def:
A king of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Rois 15:8; 
son of: Abijah (H0029I); married to Azubah (H5806); 
father of: Jehoshaphat (H3092I); also called Asaph at Matthieu 1:7,8; 
Also named: Asa (Ἀσά "Asaph" G0760)
§ Asa = "healer: injurious (?)"
1) king of Judah, son of Abijam, father of Jehoshaphat
2) a Levite

H0609H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 9:16; 
son of: Elkanah (H0511K); 
father of: Berechiah (H1296I)
§ Asa = "healer: injurious (?)"
1) king of Judah, son of Abijam, father of Jehoshaphat
2) a Levite

H0617H.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:23; 
son of: Ebiasaph (H0043); 
brother of: Kore (H6981); 
father of: Tahath (H8480H)
§ Assir = "prisoner"
1) a son of Korah
2) a son of Ebiasaph
3) a son of Jeconiah

H0621.def:
A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 41:45; 
daughter of: Potiphera (H6319); married to Joseph (H3130); 
mother of: Manasseh (H4519) and Ephraim (H0669) 
§ Asenath = "belonging to the goddess Neith"
the wife of Joseph

H0623K.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exode 6:24; 
son of: Korah (H7141I); 
brother of: Assir (H0617) and Elkanah (H0511); 
father of: Assir (H0617H) and Kore (H6981); also called Abiasaph at Exode 6:24; Asaph at 1 Chroniques 26:1; 
Another name of ev.ya.saph (אֶבְיָסָף, אֲבִיאָסָף "Ebiasaph" H0043)
§ Asaph = "gatherer"
1) the father of Hezekiah's secretary
2) a son of Berechiah, chief Levite musician under David
3) a Persian officer over the royal forest

H0630.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Esther 9:7; 
son of: Haman (H2001); 
brother of: Parshandatha (H6577), Dalphon (H1813), Poratha (H6334), Adalia (H0118), Aridatha (H0743), Parmashta (H6534), Arisai (H0747), Aridai (H0742) and Vaizatha (H2055) 
§ Aspatha = "the enticed gathered"
the third son of Haman

H0634.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 19:37; 
son of: Sennacherib (H5576); 
brother of: Adrammelech (H0152H) and Sharezer (H8272) 
§ Esarhaddon = "Ashur has given a brother"
king of Assyria in the seventh-century BC

H0635.def:
A woman living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esther 2:7; 
daughter of: Abihail (H0032K); also called Hadassah at Esther 2:7; 
Also named: ha.das.sah (הֲדַסָּה "Hadassah" H1919) 
§ Esther = "star"
the queen of Persia, heroine of the book of Esther-daughter of Abihail, cousin and adopted daughter of Mordecai, of the tribe of Benjamin, made queen by king Ahasuerus to replace divorced queen, Vashti.

H0654.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:37; 
son of: Zabad (H2066); 
father of: Obed (H5744H) 
§ Ephlal = "intercessor"
a descendant of Pharez

H0669G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 41:52; 
son of: Joseph (H3130) and Asenath (H0621); 
brother of: Manasseh (H4519); 
father of: Shuthelah (H7803), Becher (H1071H), Tahan (H8465), Ezer (H5827), Elead (H0496) and Beriah (H1283H); also called Ephrathite (NIV: Ephraimite) at 1 Samuel 1:1; Ephron (Qere, KJV: Ephrain) at 2 Chroniques 13:19; 
§ Ephraim = "double ash-heap: I shall be doubly fruitful"
1) second son of Joseph, blessed by him and given preference over first son, Manasseh
2) the tribe, Ephraim
3) the mountain country of Ephraim
4) sometimes used name for the northern kingdom (Hosea or Isaiah)
5) a city near Baal-hazor
6) a chief gate of Jerusalem

H0673G.def:
Someone descended from Ephraim, a man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 41:52; 
son of: Joseph (H3130) and Asenath (H0621); 
brother of: Manasseh (H4519); 
father of: Shuthelah (H7803), Becher (H1071H), Tahan (H8465), Ezer (H5827), Elead (H0496) and Beriah (H1283H); also called Ephrathite (NIV: Ephraimite) at 1 Samuel 1:1; Ephron (Qere, KJV: Ephrain) at 2 Chroniques 13:19; 
Group of eph.ra.yim (אֶפְרַ֫יִם "Ephraim" H0669)
§ Ephrathite = "ashiness: fruitfulness"
1) an inhabitant or descendant of Ephraim (in in Juges 12:5; 1 Rois 11:26) 
2) an inhabitant of Bethlehem (in Ruth 1:1; 1 Samuel 1:1; 1 Samuel 17:12)

H0673H.def:
A woman descended from Ephrathah of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:19; married to Caleb (H3612H); 
mother of: Hur (H2354); also called Ephrath at 1 Chroniques 2:19; 
Group of eph.ra.tah (אֶפְרָ֫תָה "Ephrathah" H0672)
§ Ephrathite = "ashiness: fruitfulness"
1) an inhabitant or descendant of Ephraim (in in Juges 12:5; 1 Rois 11:26) 
2) an inhabitant of Bethlehem (in Ruth 1:1; 1 Samuel 1:1; 1 Samuel 17:12)

H0675G.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Eri (H6179), Arod (H0720) and Areli (H0692); also called Ozni at Nombres 26:16; 
§ Ezbon = "hasting to discern: I will be enlargement"
1) a son of Gad
2) grandson of Benjamin

H0675H.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:7; 
son of: Bela (H1106A); 
brother of: Ard (H0714H), Naaman (H5283H), Uzzi (H5813I), Uzziel (H5816I), Jerimoth (H3406), Iri (H5901), Addar (H0146H), Gera (H1617I), Abihud (H0031), Abishua (H0050H) and Ahoah (H0265)
§ Ezbon = "hasting to discern: I will be enlargement"
1) a son of Gad
2) grandson of Benjamin

H0682A.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:37; 
son of: Binea (H1150); 
brother of: Raphah (H7498) and Eleasah (H0501H); 
father of: Azrikam (H5840H), Bocheru (H1074), Ishmael (H3458I), Sheariah (H8187), Obadiah (H5662J) and Hanan (H2605H)
§ Azel = "reserved"
n pr m (CLBL)
a Benjamite descendant of Saul and Jonathan

H0683.def:
A man living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 22:3; 
son of: Meshullam (H4918); 
father of: Shaphan (H8227B) 
§ Azaliah = "Jehovah (Yahweh) has reserved (set apart)"
the father of Shaphan the scribe

H0684G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:15; 
son of: Jesse (H3448); 
brother of: David (H1732), Eliab (H0446I), Abinadab (H0041I), Shimeah (H8093), Nethanel (H5417H), Raddai (H7288), Zeruiah (H6870), Abigail (H0026H)(?) and Elihu (H0453J)
§ Ozem = "I shall hasten them"
1) older brother of David
2) a descendant of Judah

H0684H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:25; 
son of: Jerahmeel (H3396); 
brother of: Ram (H7410H), Bunah (H0946), Oren (H0767), Ahijah (H0281J) and Onam (H0208H)
§ Ozem = "I shall hasten them"
1) older brother of David
2) a descendant of Judah

H0687.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:21; 
son of: Seir (H8165B); 
brother of: Lotan (H3877), Shobal (H7732), Zibeon (H6649H), Anah (H6034H), Dishon (H1787), Dishan (H1789) and Timna (H8555H); 
father of: Bilhan (H1092), Zaavan (H2190), Akan (H3292) 
§ Ezer = "treasure"
a chief of the Horites

H0690.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:38; 
son of: Ithran (H3506H); 
brother of: Jephunneh (H3312H) and Pispa (H6462) 
§ Ara = "lion"
a descendant of Asher

H0692.def:
A man of the tribe of Gad living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:16; 
son of: Gad (H1410); 
brother of: Ziphion (H6837), Haggi (H2291), Shuni (H7764), Ezbon (H0675), Eri (H6179) and Arod (H0720) 
§ Areli = "lion of God"
1) a son of Gad
2) those of the family of Areli (pater adj-Arelites)
